From 0828c4b8ab6bb16d551c5c54866ec7774c72c77a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 04 Mar 2021 20:43:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-31170] greco_arc: add greco support

Since goya2_arc is renamed to greco_arc, this patch add changes to rename
folders, files, function names from goya2 to greco. The removal of
greco folder and files will be added in subsequent patch.

Change-Id: I724a1954d56c34e6a946cbc945f03417e3f74786
---

